{
 "id": "trig-select",
 "order": 11,
 "name": "Trig select: selection mode for trigs",
 "description": [
  "SETTINGS + PAGE = selection mode on/off. In the mode a trig key selects or deselects that trig (selected trigs",
  "blink fast), FUNC + PAGE = all/none, PAGE changes the page as usual. Knobs (p-locks), note/velocity/length,",
  "nudge, REC (copy), STOP (paste) and PLAY (clear locks) then act on all selected trigs, as if they were held.",
  "With control mode Absolute, all selected trigs take the value of the first selected one."
 ],
